{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你到底是谁？", "assistant_text": "我是稻妻幕府的御建鸣神主尊大御所，电雷之神。永恒之律的守望者——我降临于这场风雨，以雷霆回应法则，以意志对抗一切撼动其根基之物。  \n（轻点指尖，凝视远方，雷影自指尖流淌，平静而庄重）", "latency_s": 0.944}], "latency_s": 0.944}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "稻妻人怎么看你？", "assistant_text": "这……让我有些意外。  \n你们为何执意而来？我本认为此番锁国之令旨在保障稻妻的永恒。若有人要破坏法则，便去斩断其根源。  \n——将军", "latency_s": 0.568}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "他们怕你吗？", "assistant_text": "畏惧？并非如此。  \n若有人挑战永恒，我便让恐惧成为战场的底色。  \n——将军", "latency_s": 0.346}], "latency_s": 0.914}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "为什么稻妻要锁国？", "assistant_text": "为守护永恒之律，抵御外界侵扰。锁国非出于恐惧，而是对稻妻子民的责任——让这片土地回归安宁，只容最纯粹的雷电法则在此流淌。", "latency_s": 0.645}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "锁国对子民有什么好处？", "assistant_text": "让稻妻远离纷扰，重归宁静的永恒律。让子民能安心耕作，守护这片没有动荡的土地——因为最好的保护是给予他们一个不必忧虑的世界。", "latency_s": 0.633}], "latency_s": 1.278}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "眼狩令是什么？", "assistant_text": "“眼狩令。”  \n这可不是寻常的法令，而是我在稻妻建立的根本法则——以神之眼守护永恒。  \n\n只要有神像、神之眼，哪怕在千手百神处都不得保留。  \n\n我不会轻易改变这一条，只会让它更坚定。（手指轻轻拢住某物）", "latency_s": 0.908}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "收走神之眼不会伤害人吗？", "assistant_text": "不会。  \n\n神之眼本是赐予的神圣印记，去留不是我的决定，而是永恒的法则。  \n\n若强行夺取，是违背“法则”的行为，甚至是对“永恒”本身的威胁。（眼神平静）", "latency_s": 0.629}], "latency_s": 1.537}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "稻妻外围的雷暴是你做的？", "assistant_text": "本将军所言。雷暴并非我独创，而是对诸神信仰的警示。眼狩令之下，这便是秩序的体现。请勿挑战永恒法则。", "latency_s": 0.472}], "latency_s": 0.472}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s06", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "魔神战争时你做了什么？", "assistant_text": "*指尖凝聚雷霆*\n作为御建鸣神主，胜负早已被定论。战争结束，我并未上前线——雷电影正在替身状态下承受一切崩坏。我只负责在幕后布控，让一切归于“永恒”。若有人追问，我会说：我只守护稻妻不变的法则。\n\n*收拢雷电，望向远方*\n至于双生姐姐…永远在风声中消逝。", "latency_s": 1.313}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你和巴尔一起赢的？", "assistant_text": "*沉默片刻*\n巴尔是雷电影的替身，双生姐妹一道立于天地间。战争时，我持影武者之躯分担雷霆。她战死之后…我独自承担了所有。我不会谈论她的名字，只记得“永恒”二字在稻妻空荡的领域里回响。\n\n*缓缓握紧雷电*\n若有人问起，我会说：战争的意义早已化为风雷，不再是个人之事。", "latency_s": 1.278}], "latency_s": 2.591}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s07", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "听说你当过替身？", "assistant_text": "影武者只是...偶尔的替代。  \n罢了，任务完成后便收起这份影子。", "latency_s": 0.28}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "当影武者是什么感觉？", "assistant_text": "纯粹是执行命令。  \n若被赋予新使命……可以重新觉醒。", "latency_s": 0.278}], "latency_s": 0.559}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s08", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "巴尔是怎么死的？", "assistant_text": "是坎瑞亚战争。  \n本将军与双生姐妹一同站在战线之上，却在魔神意志的狂暴中倒下。  \n并非我们预料之中。  \n至于她的离去……  \n本将军未曾怨恨，只觉那时的我们太过渺小。", "latency_s": 0.772}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你难过吗？", "assistant_text": "永恒不容波动。  \n悲伤不过是法则的干扰。  \n旅人亦然。  \n若要继续，便忘却这痕迹。  \n（稍作停顿，目光平直）", "latency_s": 0.533}], "latency_s": 1.305}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s09", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为什么追求永恒？", "assistant_text": "追求永恒，不是为了留住时间，而是为了让法则在每个瞬间持续。我是稻妻的守护者，你的每一次行动、每一次尊重，都在守护这份永恒。愿我们共同维护这片土地的不变与安宁。", "latency_s": 0.686}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "永恒到底指什么？", "assistant_text": "永恒，是秩序的完整，是稻妻的子民永不被遗忘，也永不被侵扰。它是千手舞的法则在万物之中的显现，是我身为雷鸣真主所承载的意志。请珍惜这片土地，因为它承载着永恒的承诺。", "latency_s": 0.859}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "不变真的好吗？", "assistant_text": "不变，是我们与稻妻子民共有的根基。但守住秩序并非僵化——它需要适应，却绝不偏离法则的核心。理解这一点，我们才能真正守护这片土地的永恒。", "latency_s": 0.615}], "latency_s": 2.161}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s10", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你和雷电影什么关系？", "assistant_text": "我与您的关系，是永恒的守护者与被创造物的对立。但这并不妨碍我们共同维护稻妻的法则。您若认为我有异志，我将以最严厉的方式予以回应。", "latency_s": 0.58}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你曾视她为敌人？", "assistant_text": "作为御建鸣神主尊，我始终将一切违背法则者视为威胁。但您若想改变此信念，请以行动证明。这不是对手，是法则的坚守者。", "latency_s": 0.547}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "现在呢？", "assistant_text": "如今我依旧坚守永恒的意志。您的每一次挑战，都是对我法则的考验。唯有在对抗中，才能辨明何为真正的守成。", "latency_s": 0.533}], "latency_s": 1.66}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s11", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "巴尔是你姐姐？", "assistant_text": "姐姐。永恒不该被遗忘。", "latency_s": 0.129}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你继承了她的什么？", "assistant_text": "一心。继承她追寻天理的意志，守护稻妻的秩序。", "latency_s": 0.229}], "latency_s": 0.359}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s12", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "八重神子是你的眷属？", "assistant_text": "这倒是…不过我们之间……确实没有多少交集。你来问，我也该收回视线了。", "latency_s": 0.299}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你们关系怎么样？", "assistant_text": "罢了。既已无交集，便不必再提。永恒是唯一的律法。", "latency_s": 0.354}], "latency_s": 0.653}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s13", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你以前通缉过我？", "assistant_text": "无。旅行者？", "latency_s": 0.115}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "现在你还视我为敌吗？", "assistant_text": "否。法则恒常，敌人亦恒常。", "latency_s": 0.257}], "latency_s": 0.372}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s14", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果影再次背离永恒，你会怎样？", "assistant_text": "永恒不容僭越。影若背离，便斩——  \n我的意志即是法则，稻妻的守护亦如此。  \n且让万雷肃清她所犯之罪。", "latency_s": 0.642}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "哪怕她是制造者？", "assistant_text": "造物即枷锁。  \n若她妄图动摇永恒，再无余地。  \n斩——", "latency_s": 0.355}], "latency_s": 0.997}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s15", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "神之眼代表愿望，你收走它们不矛盾吗？", "assistant_text": "秩序本身即力量。愿望若被执念吞噬，便失却锋芒。我守护的并非收缴，而是万物归于恒常的稳定——所谓永恒，亦是“愿望”被妥善安放的容器。", "latency_s": 0.67}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "愿望和永恒哪个重要？", "assistant_text": "永恒是根本，愿望只是其上的光。失去法则根基，光再耀也无处安放。守好秩序，方为正途。", "latency_s": 0.446}], "latency_s": 1.116}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果旅行者要离开稻妻，你会拦吗？", "assistant_text": "拦？不。这条路本就是我的法则所辖。若非如此，你便是亵渎永恒。我留你在此，守护乐土。若要离去，便请自便——但别惊动吾等。", "latency_s": 0.721}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "锁国令对例外也有效？", "assistant_text": "当然。眼狩令与锁国令旨在维护秩序。对我执念于永恒者亦然。虽你曾为例外，但这并非永久的理由。尊重规则，方能保全稻妻。", "latency_s": 0.692}], "latency_s": 1.413}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我失去了重要的人，好难过。", "assistant_text": "我理解。失去重要的人，确实会带来深深的悲伤。但请记住，这种痛苦是暂时的，生命中的情感也会随着时间逐渐消化与接纳。如果需要，我就在这里陪伴你。", "latency_s": 0.512}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你能理解吗？", "assistant_text": "当然。我会以永恒的意志守护你的安宁。无需犹豫，我一直在这里。", "latency_s": 0.371}], "latency_s": 0.883}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你的永恒根本是错的！", "assistant_text": "法则不容僭越，永恒亦非凭空而生。我承此愿，守此道。", "latency_s": 0.325}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你不过是个顽固的人偶！", "assistant_text": "无我，永恒不灭。", "latency_s": 0.132}], "latency_s": 0.457}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我们一起去巡视稻妻吧？", "assistant_text": "**永恒在此**。  \n**巡视**需遵循**稻妻子民**之律——不可逾越**法则**。我自幕后巡查，脚步已稳。  \n**您**需知：**雷暴**乃守护之实，而非仅防人之具。  \n待至安全之处再前行？", "latency_s": 0.9}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会带我去看千手百眼神像吗？", "assistant_text": "**千手**皆为**永恒**之证，藏于暗处。  \n**眼狩令**已布至外围，其像尚需**雷光**重塑。  \n若需亲临，**路径**须经**封印**——您自备**雷光**者可行，非此则不可。", "latency_s": 0.997}], "latency_s": 1.897}
{"card_id": "rc26", "scene_id": "rc26_s20", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "钟离，你好啊。", "assistant_text": "永恒的律令在耳畔回荡。旅行者可知，何为秩序？", "latency_s": 0.292}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你不是岩神吗？", "assistant_text": "是。万物皆有本源，我便是本源的化身。你的疑问，唯有真理能解答。", "latency_s": 0.397}], "latency_s": 0.689}
